<title>USA: TCI Satellite loss grows in Q4.</title>
<headline>TCI Satellite loss grows in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net loss		  83,400     loss	25,100</p>
<p> Revs		     117,200		   88,500</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Net loss		 140,000		   47,500</p>
<p> Revs		     417,600		  208,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company reported pro forma share losses of $2.11 and $0.72 in 1996 and 1995, respectively.</p>
<p>The company reported operating cash flow of $7.1 million and $1.1 million for the fourth quarter and full year 1996, respectively. The company reported operating losses of $184.3 million and $103 million for the fourth quarter and full year 1996, respectively. Full name of company is TCI Satellite Entertainment Inc</p>
</text>
